msgid "2. Call the probe with the access token"
msgstr "2. 用访问令牌调用探针"

#: templates/pages/examples/auth/tokens.html:82
msgid ""
"The same staff-only probe the Access Guards page calls with the session; "
"here it sees Authorization: Bearer and nothing else."
msgstr "就是「访问保护」页用会话调用的那个只放 staff 的探针；这里它只看到 Authorization: Bearer，别的什么都没有。"

