msgstr "调用探针"

#: templates/pages/examples/auth/tokens.html:96
msgid "3. Refresh"
msgstr "3. 刷新"

#: templates/pages/examples/auth/tokens.html:97
#, python-format
msgid ""
"POST %(url)s with the refresh token. Each refresh token works once: "
"showing a spent one again ends the whole sign-in, since two parties then "
"hold it."
msgstr "带着刷新令牌 POST %(url)s。每个刷新令牌只能用一次：已经用过的再出现，说明有两方拿着它，整个登录随即作废。"

#: templates/pages/examples/auth/tokens.html:101
msgid "Refresh the tokens"
msgstr "刷新令牌"

#: templates/pages/examples/auth/tokens.html:111
msgid "4. Sign out"
msgstr "4. 注销"

#: templates/pages/examples/auth/tokens.html:112
#, python-format
msgid ""
"POST %(url)s with the refresh token and the access token in the "
"Authorization header: both stop working at once, and the probe is called "
"again to show it."
msgstr "带着刷新令牌 POST %(url)s，Authorization 头里放访问令牌：两者同时失效，随后再调一次探针来证明。"

