msgstr "恢复示例数据"

#: templates/pages/examples/cache/models.html:39
msgid ""
"Read twice: the first read is a miss that stores the result, the second a"
" hit."
msgstr "连读两次：第一次未命中并写入缓存，第二次命中。"

#: templates/pages/examples/cache/models.html:40
msgid ""
"After an ORM write to one of this project's tasks, the next read is a "
"miss and shows the new title."
msgstr "通过 ORM 改这个项目的任务后，下一次读取未命中，显示新标题。"

#: templates/pages/examples/cache/models.html:41
msgid ""
"A write to another project's task leaves this project's cached query a "
"hit: its partition did not change."
msgstr "改另一个项目的任务，这个项目缓存的查询仍然命中：它所在的分区没有变。"

#: templates/pages/examples/cache/models.html:42
msgid ""
"An UPDATE statement fires no ORM event, so the next read is still a hit "
"with the old title until the task cache is invalidated. Code that writes "
"this way calls ExampleTask.invalidate_cache_on_commit(session)."
msgstr ""
"UPDATE 语句不触发 ORM 事件，所以在任务缓存失效之前，下一次读取仍然命中旧标题。这样写入的代码要调用 "
"ExampleTask.invalidate_cache_on_commit(session)。"

#: templates/pages/examples/cache/models.html:43
msgid ""
"Renaming the project makes every cached task query miss once: the "
"database deletes a project's tasks by itself, so the cache listens to "
"project writes."
msgstr "改名项目会让所有缓存的任务查询未命中一次：数据库会自己删除项目的任务，所以缓存要监听项目的写入。"

