msgstr "查询当前计数"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:6
msgid ""
"These fixed examples do not change records or kill services. The caller "
"does not retry; an RPC timeout does not prove the receiving operation was"
" cancelled."
msgstr "这些固定示例不会修改记录或终止服务。调用者不重试；RPC 超时并不代表接收端的操作已取消。"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:9
msgid "No receiver"
msgstr "没有接收者"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:11
msgid ""
"Request a reserved Demo address with no subscriber. Expect "
"NoRespondersError."
msgstr "请求没有订阅者的预留 Demo 地址，预期返回 NoRespondersError。"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:12
msgid "Request missing receiver"
msgstr "请求不存在的接收者"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:16
msgid "Slow reply"
msgstr "慢回复"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:18
msgid ""
"monitor_a waits two seconds without changing data. The caller waits only "
"0.5 seconds and then reports a timeout."
msgstr "monitor_a 等待 2 秒，不修改数据。调用者只等 0.5 秒，随后显示超时。"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:19
msgid "Request slow reply"
msgstr "请求慢回复"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:23
msgid "Receiver exception"
msgstr "接收端异常"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:25
msgid ""
"monitor_a raises an intentional ValueError. Its log contains the actual "
"error; the caller sees a timeout, not a reconstructed remote exception."
msgstr "monitor_a 主动抛出 ValueError，实际错误保留在它的日志中。调用者看到超时，不会收到重建的远程异常。"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:26
msgid "Request failing handler"
msgstr "请求异常处理函数"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:32
msgid ""
"To observe an offline node, run ./run.sh nats_b stop in a terminal, then "
"query monitor_b on the RPC page. Counter queries still show monitor_a. "
"Restart with ./run.sh nats_b start."
msgstr ""
"要观察节点离线，请在终端执行 ./run.sh nats_b stop，再到 RPC 页查询 monitor_b。计数查询仍会显示 "
"monitor_a。执行 ./run.sh nats_b start 可重新启动。"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/failures.html:33
msgid "Return to immediate RPC"
msgstr "返回即时 RPC"

#: templates/pages/examples/communication/rpc.html:6
msgid ""
"Start nats_a and nats_b in separate terminals. Select a database project "
"and the receiving service; this request waits for its reply, without "
"creating a Taskiq task."
msgstr "在独立终端分别启动 nats_a 和 nats_b。选择数据库项目和接收服务；本次请求直接等待回复，不创建 Taskiq 任务。"

